{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365680/extras/c848a269f56e2098350c5d472adbadff.avif?t=1756214672\" width=800 height=299 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ABOUT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>NONEWORLD</strong> is an RPG adventure set in strange universe caught in the grasps of despair. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As a Princess from another world, you awaken in a strange forgotten castle. Your past now only a fading memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Join forces with familiar fruity colored allies, fight horrifying foes and destroy<i> a lot </i>of farmland in your\u00a0journey to return home. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365680/extras/c0fa59e1a65f7396bab0a41f8c6bc3d0.avif?t=1756214672\" width=800 height=299 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dive into a strange hand-drawn world with an intriguing narrative. Interact with the environment to discover new information to document in the <i>Tome of Knowledge</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Experience three\u00a0immersive story chapters packed with unique gameplay systems and characters; each chapter requires roughly an hour or more to complete.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">PARTY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fight alongside <i>Mayday</i>, <i>Cloud</i> and <i>Ophelia</i> in your journey to return home. Each with a distinct, lovable personality with an important connection to the Princess.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">BATTLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Master a unique turn-based battle system. Carefully manage your party resources to combine <i>Energy</i> and <i>Revenge</i> abilities to slay a large roster of powerful monsters. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">EXPLORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore diverse environments, complete character quests, and gather items to forge powerful new ability sets. Leave no stone unturned to find the coveted <i>Shadow Weapons</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">DIFFICULTY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play through the story on several optional difficulty settings, including Irregularis: where saving is disabled and checkpoints are disabled. Once you die, <i>that's it</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">ACHIEVEMENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hunt down rare and hidden story Achievements with an always-offline progress system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>...What's not to love?</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365680/extras/cf7d7e0d892d0551c012934525d416e6.avif?t=1756214672\" width=800 height=299 /></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3365680?t=1756214672","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365680/5dbf1e2b931a6a3b4ef13e22531c787fc5818449/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756214672","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365680/582164ee6c42daba6563cbc6cbe539c0ba1c4aab/capsule_